    "description": "Angel Celestial Wind Chime\nGold-Tone Metal Tubes and Molded Resin Figurine\nVintage Style Decorative Hanging Ornament\nThis decorative wind chime features a detailed angel figurine playing a stringed instrument while soaring above a cloud base accented with small gold stars. The design reflects the celestial and angelic home decor trends popular in the late 20th century, combining musical elements with a serene, whimsical aesthetic suitable for indoor or sheltered outdoor display.\nTop section constructed from cast resin with hand-painted gold-tone accents and cloud motifs\nTen gold-tone metal chime tubes of varying lengths designed for melodic movement\nIntegrated hanging loop featuring a faux-pearl beaded cord and metal ring for secure display\nMeasures 9 inches in length by 7 inches in width\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition consistent with age. The resin angel figurine is structurally sound with no visible chips or cracks; gold-tone paint accents show light surface wear. Metal chime tubes are intact with some minor surface oxidation. Strings are present but may require light untangling. A 'Made in China' sticker is present on the reverse of one teardrop wind catcher.",
